The wine list is small but well chosen. Jake Burgy and I recorded the
eight episode of the BigBlueBall Instant Messaging podcast today, and I
think this show has the best sound quality yet.<br>
how great tohave it on tape structurally intact, with nothing out of
place but theusual finger flubs.<br>
He is much wiser than we mere puppets can fathom. there areeven some
tables on a small island in the creek, reached by afootbridge, where you
can have some potato salad and listen to theburble.<br>
He shares A List Apart, a great site for all things CSS. The food is
authentic and yet there are some selections not anywhere near the
usual.<br>
More than 1 million Louisiana residents were displaced by the hurricane
that struck on Aug. "President Bush called Saddam's death is an
'important milestone' and he is right. 7 million tagsThis got me
thinking. A Flashpresentation demonstrating the product could be very
effectivemarketing inthis case. I went to digg an article this morning
and found that Digg was indeed Down.<br>
What set's Yahoo apart is that there was no official communication to
the millions of affected Yahoo!<br>
I'll be posting daily recaps right here, so check back all week. I'll be
